<attribute name="problem" nodeId="44476545">&lt;p&gt;
    EY&apos;s Small Volume Extract (SVE) enables importing a subset of data that meets specific criteria from a larger data set
    into a training environment. This makes it possible to house more environments on a single server and reduces the time
    needed to refresh the environments.
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;
